{"2632720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Greg's Deadly Draft", "steam_appid": 2632720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632720/extras/b8259e3fd76896eeaf7d9be923c0c371.poster.avif?t=1750439814\" width=600 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632720/extras/b8259e3fd76896eeaf7d9be923c0c371.webm?t=1750439814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632720/extras/b8259e3fd76896eeaf7d9be923c0c371.mp4?t=1750439814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brought to tryout by an EVIL mascot shark...</strong></h2><br>Play against Greg White Shark in a battle for your life as he tries to recruit you for his failing football team.<br><br><u><strong><i>Use your football against targets...</i></strong></u><br>Greg is putting you through several trials to see if you would make a good fit on his roster.<br><br><strong><i><u>Throw the anchor to stop foes...</u></i></strong><br>Once used as a prop for entertainment, now utilized to stop an enemy right in it's tracks.<br><br><strong><i><u>Collect serum to gain a speed boost...</u></i></strong><br>Dropped by your adversaries is a potion that gives you an advantage in combat and stealth.<br><br><strong>Make your way to the depths of the stadium and find the clues to get your way out!</strong>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632720/extras/b8259e3fd76896eeaf7d9be923c0c371.poster.avif?t=1750439814\" width=600 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632720/extras/b8259e3fd76896eeaf7d9be923c0c371.webm?t=1750439814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632720/extras/b8259e3fd76896eeaf7d9be923c0c371.mp4?t=1750439814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brought to tryout by an EVIL mascot shark...</strong></h2><br>Play against Greg White Shark in a battle for your life as he tries to recruit you for his failing football team.<br><br><u><strong><i>Use your football against targets...</i></strong></u><br>Greg is putting you through several trials to see if you would make a good fit on his roster.<br><br><strong><i><u>Throw the anchor to stop foes...</u></i></strong><br>Once used as a prop for entertainment, now utilized to stop an enemy right in it's tracks.<br><br><strong><i><u>Collect serum to gain a speed boost...</u></i></strong><br>Dropped by your adversaries is a potion that gives you an advantage in combat and stealth.<br><br><strong>Make your way to the depths of the stadium and find the clues to get your way out!</strong>", "short_description": "Fight against Greg White Shark, the maniacal mascot whose sports team you've been recruited to try-out for.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“This game was funny... good sense of humor. Thumbs up!”<br>GameGrumps<br><br>“It was quite fun, well designed… I did actually enjoy that, liked how it had lots of different minigames, had a comedy theme to it, it was simplistic but fun to play, the controls worked well.”<br>SuperHorrorBro<br><br>“I like this in a lot of weird ways, this I think is how you’re supposed to do some mascot horror.”<br>TheGameSalmon<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632720/header.jpg?t=1750439814", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750439814", "capsule